WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.516
Welcome to Bolega India dot A I. Start by creating a business persona. Add your offering, language, tone, and the questions your assistant should ask.

00:00:12.516 --> 00:00:23.952
Next, upload your C S V or Excel contact list to a campaign. Your contacts and your business context come together in one place.

00:00:23.952 --> 00:00:34.620
Connect a phone line to your agent. When you are ready, start the campaign. Calls are paced within hourly limits.

00:00:34.620 --> 00:00:45.648
Your A I assistant speaks with customers, asks your business questions, and gathers their requirements and priorities in the conversation.

00:00:45.648 --> 00:01:00.588
After the conversation, review the lead record and transcript. Your team can understand what matters and follow up with the right questions. That is Bolega India dot A I.
